{
  "suite": "dg15",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "description": "EF.DG15 parsing: the Active Authentication public key. Upstream hands the body to d2i_EC_PUBKEY and, on failure, to d2i_RSA_PUBKEY, both under try?; the port dispatches the shared SubjectPublicKeyInfo parser on the algorithm OID with the same never-throws contract. A DH SPKI, which that parser does understand, maps to keyType \"none\", the parity value, because neither upstream reader accepts one.",
